<title>SINGAPORE: WBL to net S$59.7 mln from stake sale.</title>
<headline>WBL to net S$59.7 mln from stake sale.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>WBL Corp Ltd said on Thursday a unit of the company would sell a 51 percent stake in O'Connor's Corp Bhd and buy a 49 percent interest in O'Connor's Properties Sdn Bhd.</p>
<p>The proposed transactions would enable the WBL group to realise a net cash surplus of Singapore $59.7 million, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>The group proposed to use the proceeds to further expand the existing businesses of WIL.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
